    "description": "The updated WVUE FOX 8 news app provides New Orleans' latest breaking news, sports, and video from FOX 8. Additionally, the app provides entertainment news, strange news (Wait, What!?) and national news content, as well as Saints, LSU (SEC) and high school sports coverage. Stay informed from anywhere at any time with our new app.\r\nStay informed from anywhere at any time with our new app.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThis app requests location to help customize content for you. We will provide location information and information about your use of the app to our advertising partners in order to customize the ads displayed in this app and other apps you use.  Please review our privacy policy for more details and for your choices.",
